# One line-ending policy on every host: repository content is Unix LF.
# This keeps a native Windows checkout byte-identical to the Linux/WSL tree that the
# gates, source-identity checks and acceptance evidence measure. Owner-directed during
# P1-M4/S0. Scripts are stated explicitly so no reader guesses CRLF was intended.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.png binary
